τ²-bench (tau2-bench), Sierra Research
https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench
Pinned at commit 2174a603f6d014ef94473ffa95957f6ce27100db (package version 1.0.1)
License: MIT
License file: https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/2174a603f6d014ef94473ffa95957f6ce27100db/LICENSE

What is here from it. Both arms ran τ²-bench's airline domain, tasks 0 to 49, with its
stock agent and its user simulator. Each stored episode records the model calls it
made, so the files under runs/*/episodes/ contain text that τ²-bench wrote: the airline
policy, the user simulator's guidelines, the task instructions given to the simulated
customer, the tool definitions, and tool results read from its airline database. The
customers, their names, their user ids and their @example.com addresses are τ²-bench's
synthetic data. No τ²-bench source code is included.

τ²-bench publishes one license file, which covers its code and the data in its
repository. No separate terms for the airline data were found at the pinned commit. The
